# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DevTaskHub — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD protects the /admin analytics dashboard.
# It is read ONLY server-side inside netlify/functions/stats.ts
# (NOT VITE_-prefixed), so it is never exposed in the client bundle.
#
# Set it in Netlify:  Site settings → Environment variables → Add
#   Key:   ADMIN_PASSWORD
#   Value: skatanafas14!
#
# For local testing with the Netlify CLI (`netlify dev`), copy this
# file to `.env` and fill it in. NEVER commit the real `.env`.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
